---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import YouTubePlaylistGrid from '../components/YouTubePlaylistGrid.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';
import '../styles/videos.css';
---

<Layout
	title="KingTech | Videos"
	description="Watch videos from KingTech."
>
	<div class="page-shell">
		<main>
			<section class="intro-block video-intro-card intro-accent-card">
				<div class="video-intro-content">
					<p>
						At KingTech we always want to inspire people to experiment and discover new technology
						themselves, this is why we film our most interesting projects. 
                        On our <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@kingtech7146">Youtube channel</a> you
						can find our latest projects and tech reviews.
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Crafty Creations:</b><br>
						From Arduino-powered LED displays to Raspberry Pi home automation, we'll explore projects
						that blend code, circuits, and imagination. Whether you're a seasoned maker or a curious
						newbie, there's a project here with your name on it.
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Build Guides Galore:</b><br>
						From budget-friendly gaming PCs to high-end workstations, we'll walk through every step
						of the assembly process. 
					</p>

					<p>
						<b>Server Shenanigans:</b><br>
						Servers aren't just for data centers - they're for home labs, too! Let's explore setting up
						a home server, whether it's for media streaming, file storage, or hosting your own website.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="video-intro-image">
					<img src="/videocreation.png" alt="KingTech video creation projects" />
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-block video-topic-card">
				<div>
					<h2>PC builds</h2>
					<p>
						On the KingTech youtube channel you will find multiple PC and server builds. Creating
						technology has always been the base of the KingTech operation, and computers are no
						exceptions. In our PC build video's we show you how the PC's in our office and our servers
						are build. Every now and then someone asks us to build a PC for them, whenever we accept
						such a request we try to make a video about it and add them to the PC build playlist as
						well.
					</p>

					<YouTubePlaylistGrid
						playlistId="PLCTxFN9iaBYUgMO5MhWv8i0ZprEYSDBBK"
						limit={3}
						fallbackText="Latest playlist videos are temporarily unavailable."
					/>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-block video-topic-card">
				<div>
					<h2>Reviews</h2>
					<p>
						KingTech exists to create new technology, and as technology freaks we love our gadgets.
						Hence, another thing we do on the KingTech youtube channel, is building and reviewing
						electronics and gadgets. If you are interested in that, do subscribe to the channel to
						make sure you wont miss out on anything!
					</p>

					<YouTubePlaylistGrid
						playlistId="PLCTxFN9iaBYVAvyhnvoMlzZgcKVZwfZKf"
						limit={3}
						fallbackText="Latest playlist videos are temporarily unavailable."
					/>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
